---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import mountain from '../assets/images/banner/unsplash-1506905925346.jpg';
---
<section class="pa-section" id="panic-arrives">
  <svg class="pa-flow" viewBox="0 0 1440 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
    <path d="M-20 520 C 360 420, 600 640, 900 500 S 1320 380, 1460 460" fill="none" stroke="#8A4BE1" stroke-opacity="0.35" stroke-width="1.2" />
    <path d="M-20 560 C 380 460, 620 680, 920 540 S 1330 420, 1460 500" fill="none" stroke="#8A4BE1" stroke-opacity="0.22" stroke-width="1.2" />
  </svg>
  <div class="bx-wrap pa-grid">
    <div class="pa-media">
      <Image src={mountain} alt="Mountain peaks above a sea of clouds at dusk" widths={[480, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 560px" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="pa-copy">
      <h2 class="bx-title pa-heading">panic arrives fully formed</h2>
      <p class="bx-text">Stress can build before we notice it. When it arrives, familiar coping skills can be harder to reach.</p>
      <p class="bx-text">So we train the mind while it is calm. A few minutes each evening, so the skills are already there on the day you need them.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
